    "body": "I wonder if the 604.1 is a constant, or just updated at a different pace than other UAs?\r\n\r\nI would be curious to know what the `applicationName` value passed to https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/daf65f7252fae53104aac1e530d887888daa2d34/Source/WebCore/platform/ios/UserAgentIOS.mm#L84 is - but it seems like that part isn't open source.",
